  <section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> THE ARENA IS OPEN <span class="eyebrow-divider">/</span> SEASON 04</div><h1>Good code.<br><span>Great instincts.</span></h1><p class="hero-lede">A place to sharpen your thinking, take on real challenges, and see how you stack up. Your next breakthrough starts with one problem.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-lime" href="<%=ctx%>/user/problems.jsp">Browse All Problems <span>↗</span></a><a href="#how" class="text-link">See how it works <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-proof"><div class="avatar-stack"><i>J</i><i>M</i><i>A</i><i>+</i></div><span><strong>Built for curious minds.</strong><br>Show up, solve something, grow.</span></div></div>
  <div class="hero-art"><div class="art-glow"></div><div class="editor-card"><div class="editor-head"><div class="window-dots"><b></b><b></b><b></b></div><span>two-sum.py</span><span class="editor-lang">PYTHON 3</span></div><div class="code-lines"><div><em>01</em><span><i>def</i> <strong>two_sum</strong>(nums, target):</span></div><div><em>02</em><span class="indent"><i>seen</i> = {}</span></div><div><em>03</em><span class="indent"><i>for</i> i, n <i>in</i> <strong>enumerate</strong>(nums):</span></div><div><em>04</em><span class="indent2">if target - n in seen:</span></div><div><em>05</em><span class="indent3"><b>return</b> [seen[target - n], i]</span></div><div><em>06</em><span class="indent"><i>seen</i>[n] = i</span></div><div class="cursor-row"><em>07</em><span class="indent"><b>return</b> []<span class="cursor"></span></span></div></div><div class="editor-foot"><span><b class="pass-dot"></b> All tests passed</span><span>0.04s <span class="sep">·</span> 12.8 MB</span></div></div><div class="float-chip chip-score"><span class="chip-icon">✳</span><div><small>YOUR BEST</small><strong>+240 <small>pts</small></strong></div></div><div class="float-chip chip-streak"><span>↗</span> Keep the streak alive</div><div class="hero-index">01 <span>/</span> 03</div></div></section>
