  <section id="contests" class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 <span class="eyebrow-divider">/</span> FIND YOUR PEOPLE</div><h2>Challenges worth<br>showing up for<span class="brand-dot">.</span></h2></div><a href="<%=ctx%>/user/contest-dashboard.jsp" class="text-link">Browse all contests <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="contest-grid"><article class="contest-card featured"><div class="contest-art art-purple"><div class="orb orb-one"></div><div class="orb orb-two"></div><span class="contest-issue">WEEKLY SERIES <b>04</b></span><span class="art-symbol">{ }</span></div><div class="contest-body"><div class="contest-meta"><span class="pill pill-live"><i></i> OPEN NOW</span><span>⏱ &nbsp;2 hours</span></div><h3>The Sunday Sprint</h3><p>Five problems. One leaderboard. A fresh start every week.</p><div class="contest-bottom"><div class="mini-avatars"><i>AK</i><i>SR</i><i>+128</i></div><a href="<%=ctx%>/user/contest-dashboard.jsp" class="round-arrow">↗</a></div></div></article><article class="contest-card"><div class="contest-art art-orange"><div class="sun"></div><span class="contest-issue">BEGINNER FRIENDLY <b>01</b></span><span class="art-symbol">01</span></div><div class="contest-body"><div class="contest-meta"><span class="pill pill-soon">STARTS SOON</span><span>⏱ &nbsp;45 min</span></div><h3>First Steps</h3><p>Small wins, satisfying problems. Perfect for your first contest.</p><div class="contest-bottom"><div class="mini-avatars"><i>TP</i><i>ML</i><i>+42</i></div><a href="<%=ctx%>/user/contest-dashboard.jsp" class="round-arrow">↗</a></div></div></article><article class="contest-card"><div class="contest-art art-green"><div class="grid-art"></div><span class="contest-issue">ADVANCED <b>08</b></span><span class="art-symbol">∑</span></div><div class="contest-body"><div class="contest-meta"><span class="pill pill-open">JOIN ANYTIME</span><span>⏱ &nbsp;3 hours</span></div><h3>Graph Theory Lab</h3><p>Put your shortest paths and spanning trees to work.</p><div class="contest-bottom"><div class="mini-avatars"><i>NK</i><i>DV</i><i>+76</i></div><a href="<%=ctx%>/user/contest-dashboard.jsp" class="round-arrow">↗</a></div></div></article></div></section>
  <section id="how" class="how-section"><div class="wrap how-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 <span class="eyebrow-divider">/</span> YOUR NEXT MOVE</div><h2>Simple to start.<br><span>Hard to put down.</span></h2><p class="muted-copy">No complicated setup. Just you, a good problem, and the satisfying moment when it clicks.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="<%=ctx%>/user/problems.jsp">Explore Problem Set <span>→</span></a></div><div class="steps"><article><div class="step-num">01</div><div><h3>Pick a challenge</h3><p>Find the right pace, topic, and level for where you are today.</p></div><span class="step-symbol">◎</span></article><article><div class="step-num">02</div><div><h3>Think it through</h3><p>Work in a focused coding space with examples and instant feedback.</p></div><span class="step-symbol">⌘</span></article><article><div class="step-num">03</div><div><h3>Watch yourself grow</h3><p>Track your progress, climb the board, and come back stronger.</p></div><span class="step-symbol">↗</span></article></div></div></section>
